# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# <type>: feat | fix | docs | style | refactor | perf | test | build | ci | chore | revert
# <scope> (optional): deadlock | atomicity | memory | panic | pointsto | options | toys | toolchain | docs
#
# Summary: imperative mood, no trailing period, <= 72 chars.
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY the change is needed; wrap at 72 chars.
# Reference issues with "Fixes #123".
#
# Example:
# fix(deadlock): carry lock guards through Result methods
#
# Guards produced by Result::unwrap / Option helpers were previously
# dropped in the points-to graph, missing self-deadlocks through those
# paths. Fixes #121
